      "translations": {
        "en": "From him, from Ali ibn Hadeed, from Maraazam, from Abu Abdillah (peace be upon him)."
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "أَنَّ رَجُلًا أَتَى رَسُولَ اللَّهِ (صلى الله عليه وآله) فَقَالَ يَا رَسُولَ اللَّهِ إِنِّي أُصَلِّي فَأَجْعَلُ بَعْضَ صَلَاتِي لَكَ فَقَالَ ذَلِكَ خَيْرٌ لَكَ فَقَالَ يَا رَسُولَ اللَّهِ فَأَجْعَلُ نِصْفَ صَلَاتِي لَكَ فَقَالَ ذَلِكَ أَفْضَلُ لَكَ فَقَالَ يَا رَسُولَ اللَّهِ فَإِنِّي أُصَلِّي فَأَجْعَلُ كُلَّ صَلَاتِي لَكَ فَقَالَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ (صلى الله عليه وآله) إِذاً يَكْفِيَكَ اللَّهُ مَا أَهَمَّكَ مِنْ أَمْرِ دُنْيَاكَ وَ آخِرَتِكَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "That a man came to the Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him and his family) and said, 'O Messenger of Allah, I pray and I dedicate part of my prayer to you.' He said, 'That is better for you.' He said, 'O Messenger of Allah, so I dedicate half of my prayer to you.' He said, 'That is superior for you.' He said, 'O Messenger of Allah, so I pray and I dedicate all of my prayer to you.' The Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him and his family) said, 'Then Allah will suffice you for what concerns you from the affairs of your world and your Hereafter.'"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "ثُمَّ قَالَ أَبُو عَبْدِ اللَّهِ (عليه السلام) إِنَّ اللَّهَ كَلَّفَ رَسُولَ اللَّهِ (صلى الله عليه وآله) مَا لَمْ يُكَلِّفْهُ أَحَداً مِنْ خَلْقِهِ كَلَّفَهُ أَنْ يَخْرُجَ عَلَى النَّاسِ كُلِّهِمْ وَحْدَهُ بِنَفْسِهِ إِنْ لَمْ يَجِدْ فِئَةً تُقَاتِلُ مَعَهُ وَ لَمْ يُكَلِّفْ هَذَا أَحَداً مِنْ خَلْقِهِ قَبْلَهُ وَ لَا بَعْدَهُ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Then Abu Abdillah (peace be upon him) said: 'Indeed, Allah mandated for the Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him and his family) what He did not mandate for anyone from His creation. He mandated that he go out against all people alone, by himself, if he did not find a group to fight with him. And He did not mandate this for anyone from His creation before him or after him.'"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "quran_quote",
      "arabic_text": "فَاقْتُلُوا فِي سَبِيلِ اللَّهِ لَا تُكَلَّفُ إِلَّا نَفْسَكَ",
      "translations": {
        "en": "So fight in the cause of Allah; you are not held accountable except for yourselves."
      }
    },
